# apps/web build-context ignore.
#
# NOTE: both Dockerfiles build from the MONOREPO ROOT, so Docker reads the
# ROOT `.dockerignore` — this file is here for anyone who runs
# `docker build apps/web` directly, and to keep the rules discoverable next
# to the Dockerfile. Keep it in sync with the root one.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
out
.turbo
**/.turbo
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
*.log
